r","textMapHash":527086874,"text":"We completed her unfinished adventure, at least.","nextNodeIds":[751380216]},{"nodeId":751380216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3308409834,"text":"Yeah, and we also promised to spread the word about this adventure. Once everyone knows that we found the Tonatiuh, Bona will become a famous adventurer too, right?","nextNodeIds":[751380217]},{"nodeId":751380217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1734837866,"text":"Then, it's time to go to the volcano and find \"that person,\" and then...","nextNodeIds":[751380218]},{"nodeId":751380218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4025189266,"text":"Yeah. Let's get to the bottom of all this.","nextNodeIds":[751380219]},{"nodeId":751380219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2912725546,"text":"Are you talking about that strange \"person\" you saw in the memory?","nextNodeIds":[751380220]},{"nodeId":751380220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1671826994,"text":"That said, who on earth is that guy? The one who left that golden pattern all along our path, maybe? Paimon's getting more curious by the minute!","nextNodeIds":[751380221]},{"nodeId":751380221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2310946226,"text":"He also said he takes on different guises, so even if we have run into him, we might not have recognized him...","nextNodeIds":[751380222]},{"nodeId":751380222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":2756198994,"text":"Rawr!","nextNodeIds":[751380223]},{"nodeId":751380223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":164897330,"text":"#You're curious as well, huh, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}?","nextNodeIds":[751380224]},{"nodeId":751380224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1677152714,"text":"Now that we've found one token, let's keep up the momentum and find a way to locate another one.","nextNodeIds":[751380225]},{"nodeId":751380225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3995250322,"text":"#Then, we'll head to the volcano with {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}. We should be able to get to the bottom of everything there, and help lift {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}'s curse to boot.","nextNodeIds":[751380226]},{"nodeId":751380226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":453432170,"text":"Sorry, Bona! We're taking the Golden Entreaty with us for now. We'll tell you the whole story once we've figured it all out!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7513802,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7513801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7500203","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_10172:-109.248,1237.634,10037.270]"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7513801,7513802],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","count":31},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","count":10},{"roleType":"TALK_R